              "text": "کارشناس (kârshenâs) — \"an expert, an analyst\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "یک کارشناس خانه را دید و قیمت گذاشت. yek kârshenâs khâne râ did va qeymat gozâsht. An expert looked at the house and set a price."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Kâr \"work\" + shenâs \"knowing\". Kârshenâsi is also a bachelor's degree."
            }
          ]
        },
