          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کارشناس (kârshenâs) is native Persian, built from kâr \"work\" + shenâs-, the present stem of shenâkhtan \"to know\", which EtymDB traces through Old Persian to PIE ǵneh₃- \"to know\"."
            }
          ]
